n at SEV2 for checkout-api. The create call timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. It showed the incident was already created, so I did not open a duplicate. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current state.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails, and why the orchestrator halted the first rollback. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until that is fixed.", "type": "text"}]}]}